<title>USA: TABLE - AnnTaylor Stores Corp Q2 net.</title>
<headline>TABLE - AnnTaylor Stores Corp Q2 net.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			  1996</p>
<p> Shr		 $	 0.03	   $	 0.03</p>
<p> Net			    812			627</p>
<p> Revs		     184,999		  187,862</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  25,799		   23,237</p>
<p>6  MONTHS  Shr		 $	 0.28	   $	 0.11</p>
<p> Net			  7,287		    2,439</p>
<p> Revs		     382,063		  372,329</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  25,782		   23,226</p>
<p>	  (In thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 Q2 oper net per share, or income per share before extraordinary loss, was $0.04 vs $0.03.</p>
<p>1997 Q2 extraordinary loss, net of income tax benefit of $130,000, was $173,000, or $0.01 per share.</p>
<p>Per share figures are after deduction of goodwill amortization of $0.11 per share in the second quarer of 1997 and $0.10 per share in the second quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>Periods ended Aug 2 vs Aug 3.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
